codex
The independent check now agrees with the generator on eight fully expanded demo polynomials, not just with its own verifier. I also found and fixed a subtle G8 issue: the canonical key deliberately forgets coefficient-to-generator assignments in nonfinal factors, so the self-test now applies that exact Corollary 3.6 symmetry and verifies the carried certificate, rather than claiming invariance without exercising the map.
