 The compact route notices the repeated coefficient multiset, sums only one row in each branch, computes three modular powers, and scales six terminal coefficients. At hard this is at most 237 exact operations. That is short enough once the invariant is found but is not the mechanical 18,531-operation scan a no-tool model can execute in context.
 
